  "about": "design §6.4 R8 手机上: 横屏适配 off, two pages: the one on top upright gets a back (canPop true, didPop true: paused and callback cleared), then the window is made landscape-shaped (host:landscape, by wp_adb.ps1 -LandscapeMethod) and the page under gets a back (canPop false by B 1296-1299, didPop false, PC: Get.back). Reported: canPop (android.canPop before each back) and the back handling's lines (events.back:*.pops, S0a's observer); not whether the page is left (both leave, design wp8#5). Control: canPop upright vs sideways",
